entry.summary:
I built a lightweight profile card pattern that focuses on clarity, flexible layout, and a single social icon. It’s intended for portfolios, team pages, and small UI components where you want a clean, accessible card without a heavy framework. Created with HTML, CSS and JS and easy to edit or extend. Preview and edit the example in the CodLico HTML Editor: https://codlico.com/tools/html-editor-online/ HTML: <!DOCTYPE html>
